              "value": "(auditory, mental)\n\nThe clockwork brewer clearly delivers a disarmingly friendly greeting to a creature within 30 feet. The creature attempts a 17 Will save. On a failure, the creature is flat-footed against the clockwork brewer's next attack before the end of the brewer's next turn.\n\nThe target is then immune to Pre-Programmed Greeting for 1 day"
